data: {"answer": "This room is **On the Lake · Offsite Backup**. It displays a copy of data rows away from the resort, representing the offsite part of the 3-2-1 backup rule. You can see the **Backup System** and controls for **3-2-1 Backups with an Offline Copy**. Key concepts visible here include **BCP**, **RTO & RPO**, and procedures regarding **Ransomware or encrypted files**.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Backup System do?", "en": "What does the Backup System do?", "zh": "備份系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.98, "total_s": 9.0}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "rowboat", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "rowboat"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.7}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "rowboat", "label": "Room", "en": "On the Lake", "zh": "湖面上的小船"}, {"key": "backup", "label": "System", "en": "Backup System", "zh": "備份系統"}, {"key": "backup_321", "label": "Control", "en": "3-2-1 Backups with an Offline Copy", "zh": "3-2-1 備份與離線副本"}, {"key": "c_bcp", "label": "Concept", "en": "BCP, RTO & RPO", "zh": "營運持續、RTO 與 RPO"}], "edges": [{"a": "backup", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "rowboat"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "rowboat"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "backup_321"}, {"a": "backup_321", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "rowboat"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: On the Lake · Offsite Backup\nWhat it shows: A copy of the data rows away from the resort: the offsite copy of the 3-2-1 backup rule.\nKey lesson: Keep 3 copies on 2 kinds of media with 1 offsite, plus one offline or immutable copy against ransomware.\nSystems here: Backup System\nControls you can see: 3-2-1 Backups with an Offline Copy\nConcepts: BCP, RTO & RPO\nProcedures to know: Ransomware or encrypted files\nExits: Lighthouse · Security Operations Center, Pier · Deliveries & Vendors (called 'Clubhouse Pier' in the tour)", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.98, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 580, "prompt_s": 2.24, "gen_tokens": 91, "gen_s": 6.72, "tok_per_s": 13.5, "first_token_s": 2.26}}, "state": {}}

